$ minijuvix termination calls --help
>
Usage: minijuvix termination calls [--no-colors] [--show-name-ids]
                                   [--only-errors] [--no-termination]
                                   [MINIJUVIX_FILE]
                                   [-f|--function fun1 fun2 ...]
                                   [-d|--show-decreasing-args ARG]

  Compute the calls table of a .mjuvix file

Available options:
  --no-colors              Disable ANSI formatting
  --show-name-ids          Show the unique number of each identifier when pretty
                           printing
  --only-errors            Only print errors in a uniform format (used by
                           minijuvix-mode)
  --no-termination         Disable termination checking
  MINIJUVIX_FILE           Path to a .mjuvix file
  -f,--function fun1 fun2 ...
                           Only shows the specified functions
  -d,--show-decreasing-args ARG
                           possible values: argument, relation, both
  -h,--help                Show this help text
>= 0

$ minijuvix termination graph --help
